# CaseVault Trivy Ignore Configuration
# Per AGENTS.md rules: ignore a CVE only in .trivyignore with:
# - reason
# - evidence (grep showing the feature is unused)
# - fix requirement
# - review date

# Reason: spring-webmvc 6.2.19, RCE via XsltView path limitation; fixed only in Spring Framework 7.0.9
# Evidence: Get-ChildItem src -Recurse -Include *.java,*.html,*.xml,*.properties | Select-String -Pattern "XsltView|SseEmitter|ResponseBodyEmitter|text/event-stream" returns nothing (feature is not used)
# Fix requirement: Spring Framework 7.0.9 or later (needs Spring Boot 4.x, which AGENTS.md currently forbids)
# Review date: 2026-12-01
CVE-2026-47884

# Reason: spring-webmvc 6.2.19, SSE stream corruption with views; fixed only in Spring Framework 7.0.9
# Evidence: Get-ChildItem src -Recurse -Include *.java,*.html,*.xml,*.properties | Select-String -Pattern "XsltView|SseEmitter|ResponseBodyEmitter|text/event-stream" returns nothing (feature is not used)
# Fix requirement: Spring Framework 7.0.9 or later (needs Spring Boot 4.x, which AGENTS.md currently forbids)
# Review date: 2026-12-01
CVE-2026-47890
